":"1939-worlds-fair","lines":{"list-row":[5,"Each row is an exhibit entry with a small pavilion number in an orange circle, plain name and detail beside it, and a thin blue rule between entries."],"card":[4,"Each card is a pavilion plate: white panel, one blue geometric icon (sphere or spire) at top, plain title and details below, orange bar rising on hover."],"map":[3,"The map is a fair-ground plan with real streets north up; pins are numbered orange spheres, and the chosen one grows a blue spire marker with its label."],"form-field":[5,"Fields are numbered exhibit steps: an orange circle number, plain label, and a blue underline field; a step fills solid blue when done, errors show in text."],"chip-filter":[5,"Filters are round sphere buttons in exhibit blue; a picked one fills orange with a check, and a small x clears it."],"search":[4,"Search is a white pill with a spire icon and typed text in plain blue; suggestions list as pavilion names with small number badges."]}},{"id":"1950s-diner-signage","lines":{"list-row":[4,"Each row is a menu board line: dish name left, a dotted leader, the price right in plain black, and a small cherry dot marks favorites."],"card":[4,"Each card is an enamel sign with a chrome trim border; the name stays in plain type, and an OPEN neon tag glows cherry when available."],"map":[3,"The map is a cream placemat street map, north up; pins are cherry neon-bulb circles with prices, and the chosen one gets a soft glow and a larger size."],"form-field":[5,"Fields are order-pad lines: a black label above, a ruled cream line to type on in plain text, a cherry underline on focus, and red text for errors."],"chip-filter":[5,"Filters are chrome-rimmed diner buttons; a picked one lights up cherry with a check, and tapping it again clears it."],"search":[4,"Search is a long chrome-edged counter bar with plain typed text; suggestions drop below as menu-board lines with the match in bold."]}},{"id":"1950s-mail-order-catalog","lines":{"list-row":[5,"