e and price in plain grotesk and a red shape for the selected row."],"card":[4,"Each card is a mini poster: open white paper, one bold shape in red, yellow or blue, and a short plain title and price below."],"map":[3,"The map is white paper with simple black streets, north up; pins are bold primary shapes with prices, and the chosen one slips slightly off its outline."],"form-field":[5,"Fields are typewriter lines: a plain label above, a black ribbon-colored underline, typed text in plain type, and a red carriage mark beside errors."],"chip-filter":[5,"Filters are key caps in grotesk; a picked cap turns yellow with a pressed shadow and a check, and tapping again clears it."],"search":[4,"Search is a typewriter line with a blinking cursor and plain typed text; suggestions strike in below as typed lines, one per row."]}},{"id":"1970s-airline-branding","lines":{"list-row":[4,"Each row is a boarding stub: the name and detail in plain grotesk, a dashed tear line, and a small three-stripe tab marks the selected row."],"card":[4,"Each card is a ticket with a header band of three curved stripes in red, orange and marigold, and plain title and price on warm white stock."],"map":[3,"The map is a route chart with real geography, north up; pins are small round livery orange badges with prices, and the chosen one gets a stripe tail."],"form-field":[5,"Fields are boarding pass boxes with small caps labels, typed text in cabin brown, an orange focus edge, and clear red error text."],"chip-filter":[5,"Filters are rounded ticket-class tags; a picked tag fills livery orange with a check, and a small x clears it."],"search":[4,"Search is a wide ticket-style bar with a stripe accent; suggestions are flight-board lines with plain place names and codes."]}},{"id":"1970s-nasa-graphics-manual","lines":{"list-row":[5,"Each row is a numbered spec line: a section number at left, plain name and values in columns, a thin gray rule below, and red marks the selected row."],"card":[5,"Each card is a manual spec panel with a section number, a plain title, a measured margin, and dimension callouts in small type."],"map":[3,"The map is a gridded technical chart, north up, with real streets in gray; pins are numbered red squares with labels, and the chosen one is solid red."],"form-field":[5,"Fields are specification entries: a numbered label above, a boxed typed value in black, a red edge on focus, and red text for errors."],"chip-filter":[5,"Filters are numbered option boxes in a spec table; a selected one fills red with a check, and a Reset link clears all."],"search":[5,"Search is a boxed index lookup with a numbered label, typed text in black, and suggestions in a ruled table with section numbers."]}},{"id":"1970s-supergraphics","lines":{"list-row":[4,"Each row sits on a plain white band, with a short orange and mustard stripe bending at its left edge to mark the selected row."],"card":[4,"Each card is a plaster-white panel with a stripe band that wraps around one corner, and plain title and price on the white part."],"map":[3,"The map is a plain white street map, north up; pins are orange discs with prices, and a mustard stripe route bends along the chosen path."],"form-field":[5,"Fields are white boxes with brown labels above and typed text in plain brown; focus draws a thick orange stripe along the edge, and errors show in red text."],"chip-filter":[5,"Filters are rounded stripe pills; a picked one fills orange with a mustard edge and a check, and a small x clears it."],"search":[4,"Search is a wide white bar with a stripe band bending around its end; suggestions list below as plain brown text lines."]}},{"id":"1980s-computer-manual","lines":{"list-row":[5,"Each row is a numbered manual entry in mono: number, name, and value in columns, with a dotted rule below and a green arrow marking the selected row."],"card":[5,"Each card is a manual page with a chapter number, a plain mono title, a sample command line in a tan box, and plain details."],"map":[3,"The map is a line-drawn manual figure, north up, with real streets; pins are numbered circles with a legend table beside, and the chosen one fills green."],"form-field":[5,"Fields are command prompts: a mono label, a boxed input with a green caret and typed text, and error text beginning with ERROR in plain words."],"chip-filter":[5,"Filters are bracketed options like [ ] and [x] in mono; a checked one shows [x] with an orange mark, and a Clear command resets them."],"search":[5,"Search is a command prompt line starting with a > sign, with typed text in mono and suggestions listed as numbered commands."]}},{"id":"1980s-hip-hop-flyers","lines":{"list-row":[4,"Each row is a flyer line in condensed caps: name big at left, price and place in plain type at right, and the selected row is printed in day-glo orange."],"card":[4,"Each card is a cut-and-paste flyer block with a headliner name in condensed caps, a date and place line, and a plain price below."],"map":[3,"The map is a black and white photocopy street map, north up and readable; pins are day-glo orange squares with prices, and the chosen one grows larger."],"form-field":[5,"Fields are stamped flyer boxes: condensed caps labels, typed text in plain black on paper, a thick black edge on focus, and orange error text with a mark."],"chip-filter":[5,"Filters are torn-label tags in condensed caps; a picked tag fills day-glo orange with a check, and tapping again clears it."],"search":[4,"Search is a wide photocopy-black bar with typed text in plain white; suggestions stack below as ranked name lines in condensed caps."]}}]}
