ines":{"list-row":[4,"Rows are stacked in reef bands: early rows sit on pale sand and later rows deepen toward blue, while names and prices stay high contrast and plain."],"card":[4,"Cards sit on a depth scale: the pale flat tone behind the top results darkens toward drop-off blue lower down, with one thin crest line on the selected card."],"map":[3,"The map keeps real north-up coast geography with water drawn in sand, turquoise and deep blue bands; pins are plain coral-rose dots with readable labels."],"form-field":[5,"Fields are soft sand-colored wells that deepen to blue as the form progresses by step, labels stay above and errors show as readable text."],"chip-filter":[4,"Filters are rounded chips on a shore line; a selected chip drops to deep blue with a turquoise crest line on top, and an x clears it."],"search":[4,"Search is a sand-flat field with a turquoise crest line under it; suggestions descend as deepening bands with plain readable text."]}},{"id":"yemeni-qamariya-windows","lines":{"list-row":[4,"Each row is a white plaster rectangle with plain name and price; saved rows get a small half-moon fanlight of three colored glass cells at the edge."],"card":[3,"Each result card is a rectangle under a half-moon arch of colored glass cells in white plaster, text sits below on plain plaster, one arch per card."],"map":[3,"The map keeps real north-up geography on plaster white; pins are small arched windows holding the price, the chosen one glows amber."],"form-field":[4,"Fields are white plaster rectangles with a thick rounded border; the focused field shows a small arch of glass cells above it, errors show in red text."],"chip-filter":[4,"Filters are small arched plaster tabs; a selected one fills its arch with colored glass cells and a visible x clears it."],"search":[4,"Search is a wide plaster bar with a half-moon of glass cells above it that glows when focused; typed query and suggestions stay plain."]}},{"id":"zero-letter-spacing","lines":{"list-row":[5,"Rows are proof-sheet lines at zero tracking, ranked by size and weight; a blue pencil tick marks saved rows and a graphite rule separates each line."],"card":[5,"Each card is a proof galley block: headline in bold size, details at regular weight, a small proofmark red corrections note marks the featured result."],"map":[3,"The map is a graphite-line proof with north up; pins are blue pencil circles holding the price, the chosen pin is circled in proofmark red."],"form-field":[5,"Fields are proof lines with the label in small bold above, a graphite underline, typed text at zero tracking, and errors as red proof marks with text."],"chip-filter":[4,"Filters are boxed proof labels; a selected one steps from 400 to 700 weight in a pre-sized box with a blue pencil underline, and an x clears it."],"search":[5,"Search is a single graphite-ruled line with the query at zero tracking; suggestions are proof lines, the highlighted one marked with a blue pencil bracket."]}},{"id":"zero-white-space","lines":{"list-row":[5,"Rows butt together like classified ads, separated only by shared 1 px hairlines; name and price are bold condensed, saved rows get a classified blue block."],"card":[5,"Cards abut in a packed newspaper grid with shared hairline rules and no gaps; only the lead card carries the halftone and a red headline."],"map":[3,"The map fills its block edge to edge with a hairline frame and north-up streets; pins are packed black price labels, the chosen one in headline red."],"form-field":[5,"Fields stack with no gaps like a coupon form, shared hairlines between them, bold labels inside the cell top, typed text plain, errors in red cell fill."],"chip-filter":[5,"Filters are a row of abutting boxed cells split by hairlines; a selected cell fills classified blue with white text, and a cell x clears it."],"search":[5,"Search is a full-width cell butted against the results with a shared hairline; suggestions are packed classified lines and the highlighted one fills blue."]}}]}
