pewriter labels above, and an urgent red tab beside any field with an error."],"chip-filter":[5,"Filters are a row of staggered folder tabs; the picked tab sits forward in manila with an x, and the others sit behind."],"search":[4,"Search is a label slot at the top of a folder, with typed text in plain type; suggestions slide out like cards from a drawer."]}},{"id":"marbled-paper","lines":{"list-row":[4,"Each row starts with a small marbled swatch unique to that item, with a thin rule between rows; text stays plain on cream paper."],"card":[3,"Collection cards have a generated marbled cover on the top third, like a book endpaper; title and details sit below on plain cream."],"map":[3,"The map is framed by a narrow marbled border like an endpaper; pins are small ink drops holding labels, with the chosen one in red."],"form-field":[5,"Fields are plain cream lines with a navy underline and clear labels; focus adds a thin marbled stripe along the bottom edge, errors in red text."],"chip-filter":[4,"Filters are small marbled pebbles with plain text on a cream label; the picked pebble gets a navy ring and an x to clear."],"search":[4,"Search is a plain cream field with a narrow marbled band above it; suggestions list below in plain serif text."]}},{"id":"marshallese-stick-charts","lines":{"list-row":[4,"Each row is a short lashed rod with a shell node at its start, and the next row's rod links to it; text stays plain mono."],"card":[3,"Cards are small lattices of crossed rods with a cowrie node at the key fact, framing the plain title and details."],"map":[3,"The map is drawn with real geography and rod lines for routes, with cross-wrap ticks where they meet; shell nodes are pins with plain labels, north up."],"form-field":[4,"Fields are rod bordered boxes with a shell node on the left that fills when valid; labels and typed text stay plain, errors show a text note."],"chip-filter":[4,"Filters are short rods tied on a line; the picked rod gets a cowrie node and gold lashing, with an x to clear it."],"search":[4,"Search is a long rod with a shell node at the end as the submit; typed text stays plain, and suggestions hang below as short rods."]}},{"id":"mashrabiya-screens","lines":{"list-row":[4,"Each row sits behind a thin strip of turned bead lattice that parts on hover or focus to reveal full detail; main text stays plain."],"card":[3,"Cards are lattice windows: a bead pattern partly covers the photo and fades on hover, while title, price and details sit plain beneath."],"map":[3,"The map sits behind a light bead lattice at the edges only; pins are small turned beads with labels, and the chosen one glows warm."],"form-field":[4,"Fields are cells in a lattice grid with plain labels above; focus lights the cell warm, and an error shows a dark cell with text."],"chip-filter":[4,"Filters are round turned beads on a spindle rail; the picked bead lights warm with an x to clear it."],"search":[4,"Search is a lattice framed slot; typed text and suggestions stay plain, and the lattice opens as results load."]}},{"id":"matchbook","lines":{"list-row":[4,"Each row is a single match in a book: a red tip dot at the left and plain text beside it, with the saved row's tip charred."],"card":[4,"Cards are matchbook covers that fold open on tap to reveal details inside, with a striker strip at the bottom holding the main action."],"map":[3,"The map sits on an open matchbook inside page, with pins as red match tips holding prices; the chosen one is burnt charcoal."],"form-field":[4,"Fields are lines printed on the inside cover with plain labels; errors add a red tip mark and a clear message."],"chip-filter":[4,"Filters are matches in a row; the picked one is struck, with a charred tip and an x to clear it."],"search":[4,"Search is a cover flap slot with typed text in plain slab type; suggestions fold down below as stacked tabs."]}},{"id":"matchstick","lines":{"list-row":[4,"Each row has a thin vertical pine stick at the left with a red head that fills